From 9bc2d463531e78c7fbb471630a1ab51f478d4405 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:54:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] DJ booth: SCREEN ONLY button + Drums & FX pad bank with
 your own sounds
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SCREEN ONLY (booth top bar)
- both decks pause where they are (▶ resumes from there), the projector
  hides the video with no fade and cuts every sounding effect; the big
  screen shows its slides / lobby. ▶, load or load-from-crate lifts it.
- the projector acts on the booth's "silence" signal (no database on that
  path): measured 52–64 ms from click to video gone; the saved state
  (media action "cut") confirms it

Drums & FX (booth top bar → 16 pads, keys 1–4 / Q–R / A–F / Z–V)
- 20 built-in sounds, synthesized in Web Audio (no sample files):
  kick, snare, clap, hi-hat, open hat, tom, rim, crash, cowbell, 808 bass,
  gunshot, laser, explosion, air horn, siren, riser, impact, whoosh,
  rewind, applause
- Edit pads: pick a pad, tap a sound to hear it and put it there, upload
  your own sound file (MP3/WAV/OGG/M4A/FLAC, ≤8 MB, stored for this screen),
  or go back to the default; saved per screen
- pads fire on pointer-down; they play on the projector (and on the booth
  with "Hear FX here"); the projector preloads uploaded sounds
- engine: one effects bus, so silence() stops everything instantly

Server: media actions cut / pad_set / pad_custom (url must be this screen's
upload) / pad_reset; dj/fx kinds pad + silence; POST s/<token>/dj/sample/
